\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Christians, seek not yet repose
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  Hear thy guardian angel say,
\par  Thou art in the midst of foes:
\par  Watch and pray.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Principalities and powers,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  Mustering their unseen array,
\par  Wait for thy unguarded hours:
\par  Watch and pray.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Gird thy heavenly armour on;
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  Wear it ever, night and day;
\par  Ambushed lies the evil one:
\par  Watch and pray.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Hear the victors who o'ercame;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  Still they mark each warrior's way;
\par  All with one sweet voice exclaim,
\par  'Watch and pray.'
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Hear, above all, hear thy Lord,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  Him thou lovest to obey;
\par  Hide within thy heart His word,
\par  'Watch and pray.'
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Watch, as if on that alone
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0  Hung the issue of the day;
\par  Pray, that help may be sent down
\par \pard      Watch and pray.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

